### Terraform ###
# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored: HashiCorp recommends committing the
# provider lock file so every machine and CI run resolves identical provider versions.
.terraform/
terraform.tfstate*
# Variable files are the usual home for tokens once they move out of providers.tf.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
